{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: only addListing, editListing, and removeListing are admitted for the fixed-block Sonic proxy/implementation pair below. They bind the exact pFT collection, payment-token identity, asking amount, and expiry; address zero is the only authenticated native-currency sentinel, and the display states the source-defined max-uint40 no-expiry rule. buy and acceptBuyOffer remain structural exact-known refusals because mutable fees/listing state, the PUT-state hash, hidden signature/Permit2 authority, and state-derived counterparties affect execution. Evidence is historical source/compiler/runtime authority, not live ownership, approval, listing, token, fee, success, future upgrades, fallback, or blind signing. See tests/erc7730-semantic-evidence/flyingtulip-market-nft.",
